---
// AvailabilityCard.astro — standalone closing CTA for the consulting homepage
---

<section class="px-gutter py-14 border-t border-line bg-surface">
  <div class="max-w-lg">
    <div class="flex items-center gap-2.5 mb-4.5">
      <span class="w-1.75 h-1.75 rounded-full bg-accent shadow-[0_0_0_3px_var(--color-accent-bg)]"></span>
      <span class="font-mono text-13 text-accent-ink tracking-loose uppercase bg-accent-bg py-0.75 px-2 rounded-sm">
        limited capacity
      </span>
    </div>
    <p class="font-serif text-2xl text-ink leading-snug tracking-tight m-0 mb-3">
      I have a day job, so I only take <em class="italic text-accent">a few clients at a time</em>.
    </p>
    <p class="font-serif text-base text-mute leading-relaxed m-0 mb-5.5">
      If you're a founder or CTO with a first version to build, or a decision you don't
      want to get wrong, email me. If I don't have room, I'll say so.
    </p>
    <div class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-5 font-mono text-13 text-mute mb-6 max-w-xs">
      <div>
        <div class="text-faint text-12 tracking-loose uppercase mb-1">based in</div>
        <div class="text-ink">California</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-faint text-12 tracking-loose uppercase mb-1">working</div>
        <div class="text-ink">remote</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-faint text-12 tracking-loose uppercase mb-1">hours</div>
        <div class="text-ink">fractional</div>
      </div>
      <div>
        <div class="text-faint text-12 tracking-loose uppercase mb-1">contact</div>
        <div class="text-ink">admin@bustamam.tech</div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <a
      href="mailto:admin@bustamam.tech"
      class="inline-block bg-ink text-bg border border-ink transition-colors duration-150 hover:bg-accent hover:border-accent py-2.5 px-4.5 rounded-sm font-mono text-xs tracking-snug no-underline"
    >
      $ start a conversation →
    </a>
  </div>
</section>
